cl100k_base.tiktoken in this directory is the cl100k_base vocabulary that the
tiktoken library (https://github.com/openai/tiktoken) downloads from
https://openaipublic.blob.core.windows.net/encodings/cl100k_base.tiktoken,
unchanged (sha256 223921b76ee99bde995b7ff738513eef100fb51d18c93597a113bcffe865b2a7).
It ships with CPersona so that the token cap of `reconstruct` counts the same
way on every machine, without a network fetch.

tiktoken's maintainers state that the repository's license applies to the
encoding files as well:
https://github.com/openai/tiktoken/issues/92#issuecomment-1497875652

That license follows.

